# POAP KINGS

> POAP KINGS (#{{ site.clanTag | safe }}) is a Clash Royale clan that mints on-chain POAPs to commemorate seasons, milestones, and member achievements. Tagline: "{{ site.tagline | safe }}".

POAP KINGS is a {{ clan.clanLeague | safe }} Clash Royale clan with {{ clan.memberCount }} members, {{ clan.totalTrophies | formatNumber | safe }} total trophies, and a {{ clan.minTrophies | formatNumber | safe }}-trophy minimum. Status: {{ clan.clanStatus | safe }}. Clan tag: #{{ site.clanTag | safe }}. Clan and roster data is refreshed locally from the Clash Royale API and pushed when it changes.

Canonical data lives in build-time JSON at `/data/*.json` and a full-content markdown bundle at `/llms-full.txt`. Fetch those to answer questions without scraping HTML.

## Core pages
- [Home]({{ site.url | safe }}/): clan overview, current stats, and recent POAP drops
- [Roster]({{ site.url | safe }}/roster/): live member table with clan rank, roles, trophies, donations, career wins, years played, collection score, and badges
- [Clan Wars]({{ site.url | safe }}/wars/): recorded river race seasons, weekly ranks, fame, and war trophy changes
- [POAP vault]({{ site.url | safe }}/vault/): full POAP collection with types and dates
- [Members hub]({{ site.url | safe }}/members/): setup guide and promotion tools for current members
- [Setup guide]({{ site.url | safe }}/members/setup/): how to link a Clash Royale account and claim POAPs
- [FAQ]({{ site.url | safe }}/faq/): clan, Clan Wars, POAP, Discord, and role questions

